# Crawl output. Working output and the per-run page store stay out of git --
# a run retains ~390 KB gzipped per PDP -- but the evidence a roadmap decision
# rests on is committed, under data/evidence/.
data/*
!data/evidence/
data/evidence/*
!data/evidence/*.gz
!data/evidence/*.json
!data/evidence/*.md
*.jsonl

# Purchase advice reports. Output, not source: each one is a snapshot of one
# marketplace on one day, and a stale recommendation that still looks
# authoritative is worse than none. The README stating the convention is kept;
# the reports are not. See reports/README.md.
reports/*
!reports/README.md
